        <item>
            <title>Version 1.8.2</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 19:17:03 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>33</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.8.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
<h4>Added</h4>
<ul>
<li><strong>Double-click a column divider to fit the column</strong> (GitHub issue #36, thanks <a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/vmware/comments/1x3uiqq/comment/pfgxio8/">u/squuiidy</a>). Double-clicking the divider to the right of any column header sizes that column to fit its widest visible value (or its header, if wider), on every tab, the same gesture as Finder and Excel.</li>
</ul>
<h4>Fixed</h4>
<ul>
<li>On macOS 26, the window&#x27;s title band and the demo-mode banner no longer start at a different left edge than the table below them, and the toolbar&#x27;s first icon now lines up with the table text.</li>
</ul>
            ]]></description>
